   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Can you try<div><br></div><div>Sys.setenv(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:17.8048000335693px\">HADOOP_USER_NAME  = &quot;hdfs&quot;)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:17.8048000335693px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:17.8048000335693px\">and then repeat your command?  I don&#39;t have a running cluster with authentication on, so I can&#39;t test it myself in the very short term.</span></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
