r\n  org.apache.hadoop.security.AccessControlException: Permission denied: user=rstudio, access=WRITE, inode=&quot;/&quot;:hdfs:supergroup:drwxr-xr-x</span></pre></div><div><br></div><div>The HDFS superuser is &quot;hdfs&quot;.</div><div><br></div><div>How can I change this setting or have ability to switch between different accounts?</div><div>I would like to run hdfs.* commands with admin or hdfs username.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers</div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div>S</div></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
